 "description": "The Trusted Platform Module ST33TPHF2XSPI, ST33TPHF2XI2C, ST33GTPMASPI & ST33GTPMAI2C (TPM) is a hardware cryptographic module which implements advanced cryptographic algorithms, including symmetric and asymmetric cryptography, as well as key and random number generation. The TPM is a complete solution implementing the Trusted Platform Module Library Specification, Family \"2.0\", Level 00, Revision 01.38, September 2016. See www.trustedcomputinggroup.org for further information on TCG and TPM.",
